 "paragraphs": [
  "The flamingos greeted Aliya, Zade and the young falcon with a chorus of hellos.",
  "“Hi,” Aliya smiled. “We are here to get the second riddle for the password to the party.”",
  "“Sure,” one flamingo replied. “What is your answer to the first puzzle?”",
  "Zade looked at the shells in his hand. “Six,” he answered.",
  "“Okay, here is your next puzzle. I make bubbles out of sand and holes in the salt marsh. I swim and have gills but I am not a fish. How many of me do you see?”"
 ],
